  "description": "Voodoo Zobop Pro At A Glance\n\nThe Zobop Pro steps up the game with upgraded suspension, drivetrain, wheels, and tyres, transforming the Zobop into a serious trail contender.\n\nFeaturing a 160mm RockShox Lyrik fork, a Super Deluxe Select rear shock, a slack 64° head angle, an extended top tube, and low standover height, the Zobop Pro delivers a stable, confidence-inspiring ride.\n\nEquipped with wide, mixed wheel size, WTB wheels and Maxxis tyres, it's built to handle everything from rugged singletrack to fast-flowing descents. Designed for both durability and performance, it’s equally at home in the bike park or out on your favourite local loops.",
